WEBVTT

00:05.572 --> 00:06.782
Are you lost?

00:07.199 --> 00:09.034
Should I lend you a map?

00:10.119 --> 00:11.829
Don't kill him, Guideau.

00:20.546 --> 00:21.964
Hmm.

00:22.189 --> 00:23.733
Guideau, come here.

00:23.980 --> 00:25.175
You come here.

00:29.471 --> 00:31.598
Do you recognize his badge?

00:32.141 --> 00:33.016
Nope.

00:33.100 --> 00:34.268
Good grief.

00:34.685 --> 00:37.855
You really have no interest in
anything other than the witch.

00:38.689 --> 00:41.024
Armies normally rely on
strength in numbers.

00:41.525 --> 00:44.653
Especially against a witch.
A small elite force wouldn't make sense.

00:45.112 --> 00:48.824
What you need is unlimited resources.

00:49.199 --> 00:52.661
However, what poses a problem is that
this battalion isn't about numbers.

00:52.953 --> 00:55.706
It's built upon an overwhelming
"unique" power.

00:56.874 --> 01:01.378
If you happen to face off against
its leader, don't expect to win.

01:01.962 --> 01:05.565
The leader of the Paladin Corps'
Sixth Battalion of the Third Continent,

01:05.565 --> 01:08.177
the Man of Ice, Matt Cugat.

01:08.844 --> 01:11.180
His power is on par with that of a witch.

01:12.973 --> 01:14.683
So that's him.

02:46.024 --> 02:50.270
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Act II)

02:58.203 --> 02:59.121
Stop, Guideau.

03:00.831 --> 03:02.974
Save your kiss for later.

03:02.974 --> 03:04.418
Huh?! Why?

03:04.751 --> 03:06.503
He's clearly the head of this operation!

03:06.962 --> 03:09.047
Finishing him off will wrap it all up!

03:09.381 --> 03:11.842
Your power is our trump card, Guideau.

03:12.592 --> 03:15.220
We still can't see
everything this case has in store.

03:15.762 --> 03:19.766
Trump cards must be used once
all the other cards are on the table.

03:20.225 --> 03:23.812
Right now, just buy some time
to let the girl run away.

03:24.146 --> 03:25.772
That's all you have to focus on.

03:27.899 --> 03:29.109
Now, then.

03:29.776 --> 03:31.987
I should focus on these guys, too.

03:32.696 --> 03:34.614
What are you muttering to yourself for?

03:35.641 --> 03:36.783
Were you talking to that hot gu...

03:37.034 --> 03:38.660
I mean, that guy from earlier?

03:40.537 --> 03:42.581
Come on, do it properly!

03:42.914 --> 03:45.709
If you get taken down,
he'll go after me next!

03:46.001 --> 03:47.210
I'm letting you run.

03:47.669 --> 03:49.669
Get out of here while
I'm dealing with him.

03:50.297 --> 03:51.340
What the hell?

03:51.757 --> 03:53.675
Then, what'll you do once I run away?

03:54.051 --> 03:55.635
Just shut up and go already.

03:56.178 --> 03:59.765
When a witch is near me,
I feel grossed out.

04:00.557 --> 04:03.060
Well... I'll gladly use the opportunity.

04:05.771 --> 04:07.664
So that's the demon sword...

04:07.898 --> 04:09.624
What he said indeed was true.

04:10.108 --> 04:12.294
Then it's all the more reason
to stop her here!

04:12.294 --> 04:14.087
Look over here!

04:14.087 --> 04:15.530
Yes, I'm looking at you.

04:25.665 --> 04:27.918
What?! She already got taken down?!

04:43.600 --> 04:44.851
That scum...

04:45.185 --> 04:46.853
I've heard about you already,

04:47.145 --> 04:50.482
but you're not even a witch,
yet you're casting stuff without moving.

04:50.982 --> 04:52.901
I was also surprised.

04:53.235 --> 04:55.862
You were faster and stronger
than I thought you'd be.

04:56.446 --> 04:58.949
That thing in your right hand
is a magical tool, right?

04:59.491 --> 05:01.618
Is that the secret to your strength?

05:02.494 --> 05:04.913
There's a lot I want to ask you,

05:05.388 --> 05:06.665
but it'll have to be later.

05:11.795 --> 05:15.924
Even if you're out to kill them,
witches don't just die easily.

05:16.675 --> 05:18.802
I hope that's the case.

05:21.680 --> 05:22.639
What the...

05:31.189 --> 05:35.277
Elemental powers sure are astounding...

05:36.236 --> 05:37.904
On par with a witch?

05:38.280 --> 05:41.158
What does that mean? He's not human?

05:41.741 --> 05:43.577
No, he's human.

05:44.202 --> 05:46.246
But he has made a pact.

05:46.663 --> 05:47.956
A pact?

05:48.248 --> 05:49.182
Yes.

05:50.208 --> 05:53.670
Matt Cugat made a pact with
a primordial power on par with a witch...

05:53.962 --> 05:56.756
The Great Ice Elemental.

05:58.758 --> 06:00.552
He's an Elemental Spellcaster.

06:12.647 --> 06:13.899
Ouch...

06:14.082 --> 06:15.334
What's with that guy?

06:16.568 --> 06:18.111
He's like a witch...

06:19.446 --> 06:21.072
Ashgan! Where are you?!

06:21.698 --> 06:22.657
Over here.

06:23.366 --> 06:24.784
Come this way.

06:26.470 --> 06:28.088
- Thank goodness...
- No.

06:28.371 --> 06:29.247
Huh?

06:29.456 --> 06:31.208
I wasn't calling you.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.084
Yes.

06:33.502 --> 06:34.503
I meant you.

06:38.340 --> 06:39.424
A demon sword...

06:39.799 --> 06:43.178
I'm glad we were able to secure it
before it has done anything strange.

06:43.470 --> 06:44.346
Give it back!

06:44.763 --> 06:45.764
Give it back?

06:46.223 --> 06:50.243
Something this hazardous,
to a murderous witch?

06:55.899 --> 06:57.899
I know that I won't be able to win.

06:58.235 --> 06:59.528
What should I do...

07:03.448 --> 07:05.909
I've got you this time!

07:07.327 --> 07:08.286
You're alive!

07:08.620 --> 07:11.706
I bought you so many seconds,
why haven't you gone off?!

07:12.040 --> 07:13.583
Aren't you a witch?!

07:13.959 --> 07:17.003
Sorry that I'm not some great witch.

07:20.257 --> 07:20.924
Huh?

07:22.592 --> 07:24.611
No! You must not let him have it!

07:27.681 --> 07:29.140
What powerful strength...

07:31.476 --> 07:33.536
Give the demon sword to me!

07:34.437 --> 07:36.856
Ha! Do you want this thing that bad?

07:42.737 --> 07:45.282
It's not like I'm interested
in something like this...

07:45.782 --> 07:49.494
I just don't want to
let you guys have a single thing!

07:53.540 --> 07:55.250
What are you doing?!

07:56.042 --> 07:57.752
How annoying...

07:59.462 --> 08:02.591
I was surprised.
Her hands got ahold of Ashgan,

08:02.841 --> 08:04.634
but she was able to
let him go of her own accord.

08:04.926 --> 08:06.926
That was the first time
I've seen a human like that.

08:14.394 --> 08:15.520
Dammit!

08:18.231 --> 08:19.649
You again?

08:20.108 --> 08:21.318
Hey, give it back already!

08:21.943 --> 08:24.295
That's not something
you should carry with you!

08:24.295 --> 08:26.047
That's right. Hurry and let me go.

08:26.047 --> 08:27.340
I hate you.

08:27.340 --> 08:28.742
If you want it, then do what you're told.

08:28.992 --> 08:30.201
Shut up and follow me.

08:30.327 --> 08:31.077
What?!

08:31.411 --> 08:33.288
We'll regroup with Ashaf now.

08:34.414 --> 08:36.124
This girl is telling me around...

08:36.725 --> 08:38.977
Ashaf, where should we meet up?

08:39.419 --> 08:41.880
Is the girl okay, Guideau?

08:41.880 --> 08:43.773
She's right by me,
and she's at my beck and call.

08:44.090 --> 08:44.841
Beck and call?

08:45.300 --> 08:46.968
Now we just have to get the hell out of...

08:49.471 --> 08:50.430
What happened?

08:52.390 --> 08:54.643
Hey! Run as fast as you can!

09:05.195 --> 09:06.988
Is he trying to freeze the entire city?!

09:09.658 --> 09:11.409
Too slow! It'll catch up with you!

09:11.910 --> 09:12.786
Over here!

09:13.828 --> 09:15.163
What are you planning to do?

09:15.413 --> 09:18.333
Once we get past here,
make sure to grab my hand!

09:25.006 --> 09:27.759
What's with this minuscule spell?

09:28.134 --> 09:30.428
Can you not call me minuscule again?

09:31.012 --> 09:33.390
I hate that word.

09:33.723 --> 09:35.909
You're the one who said
women aren't defined by size...

09:35.909 --> 09:38.061
Shut up! Both of you!

09:40.271 --> 09:41.231
What the...

09:45.318 --> 09:46.277
You've got to be kidding.

09:52.534 --> 09:53.576
This...

09:54.244 --> 09:55.829
What am I supposed to do here?

10:02.085 --> 10:03.169
Pontevert.

10:03.670 --> 10:06.381
This town is in the southern part
of the Third Continent,

10:06.715 --> 10:08.883
a beautiful town
blessed with fine weather.

10:09.759 --> 10:11.302
The food is delicious, too.

10:11.928 --> 10:12.846
It's on the house.

10:13.096 --> 10:15.532
- Wow!
- And the men are passionate.

10:16.182 --> 10:19.185
My witch blood
charms people so much it's scary!

10:19.519 --> 10:21.855
Ah... what a nice town.

10:23.565 --> 10:26.860
Early this morning,
six bodies were found in town.

10:27.444 --> 10:30.238
The bodies were dismembered
by a bladed weapon,

10:30.572 --> 10:33.450
and the wounds show signs of severe
damage from magic-infused strikes.

10:33.867 --> 10:38.747
It's being thought to have been
done by someone who uses magic.

10:39.497 --> 10:43.960
These victims are all
people I met yesterday...

10:44.794 --> 10:46.880
Ashgan! Did you do something again?!

10:48.965 --> 10:52.385
What do you think I'm able
to do in this sealed form?

10:53.094 --> 10:54.471
It's the opposite, Helga.

10:55.013 --> 10:57.515
If there's something
you want to do, then...

10:59.684 --> 11:01.603
Unsheathe me, Helga.

11:02.437 --> 11:04.773
You're in a time of absolute crisis.

11:05.273 --> 11:07.859
If you don't unsheathe me,
you'll lose your life!

11:09.694 --> 11:11.279
It's no use, demon sword.

11:12.447 --> 11:14.240
The witch won't be moving anymore.

11:14.699 --> 11:16.201
An elemental's power, huh?

11:16.868 --> 11:18.495
I also hate you.

11:19.412 --> 11:21.331
Put some armor on those witches.

11:28.838 --> 11:31.716
This is your first time
in armor, isn't it?

11:32.008 --> 11:35.303
It uses acupuncture to
block the release of magic,

11:35.512 --> 11:37.347
a restraining tool for witches.

11:39.182 --> 11:40.016
Hm?

11:41.017 --> 11:43.017
That reminds me, they have an accomplice.

11:43.645 --> 11:45.730
I received a report
saying he's quite skilled.

11:46.147 --> 11:49.192
"Quite skilled"? What an honor.

11:49.776 --> 11:52.487
You also have considerable strength.

11:53.196 --> 11:56.950
It'd be a problem for me if you
take those two along with the demon sword.

11:57.342 --> 11:58.493
I see.

12:00.245 --> 12:02.205
Then, have that problem.

12:10.463 --> 12:12.048
Take them to the base.

12:12.423 --> 12:14.634
I'll deal with this guy.

12:15.635 --> 12:17.887
I'll regroup with the Colonel.

12:18.346 --> 12:20.139
You lot, take the witches to the base.

12:22.016 --> 12:25.603
Well, well. Guess I couldn't
stop you from taking them away.

12:26.187 --> 12:28.147
But this is perfect timing.

12:28.439 --> 12:30.650
I actually have something
I want to talk to you about.

12:31.000 --> 12:31.943
What?

12:32.735 --> 12:34.946
I'm quite a good judge of
someone's character, you see.

12:35.530 --> 12:37.657
Man of Ice, Matt Cugan.

12:38.199 --> 12:42.412
I perceived you as a guy who would listen
to me if I just approach you sincerely.

12:42.954 --> 12:44.247
Don't joke with me.

12:44.789 --> 12:49.502
You interfered with our mission,
how can that be called sincere?

12:52.672 --> 12:55.049
It's about that mission, actually.

12:55.341 --> 12:57.719
Don't you think something is suspicious?

12:58.177 --> 12:58.970
Hm?

12:59.780 --> 13:01.890
The witch, and the six victims...

13:02.473 --> 13:05.435
All of them happen to
just have witnesses around,

13:05.518 --> 13:08.980
and they were all murdered
by a witch with sword spells?

13:09.480 --> 13:12.067
If a witch just wants to kill humans,

13:12.068 --> 13:14.068
they have plenty of
options on how to do it.

13:15.111 --> 13:18.114
It's like she's asking to
be sent to the gallows.

13:18.531 --> 13:20.950
Too easy,
and it's like she's taunting you.

13:21.367 --> 13:22.869
In other words, witch-like behavior.

13:23.804 --> 13:25.955
Even though it's
diminished around the world,

13:26.247 --> 13:28.583
fear against witches
is still deeply-rooted.

13:28.833 --> 13:31.461
Just because someone dies
when a witch is around,

13:31.669 --> 13:34.297
it gets treated as a witch incident.
That's how sensitive things are.

13:35.214 --> 13:37.133
Even without solid evidence,

13:37.467 --> 13:40.345
it's so easy to frame
witches as criminals.

13:40.929 --> 13:42.847
And that's how it is in this case as well.

13:43.723 --> 13:47.393
Helga Velvette is being
framed by someone else.

13:50.229 --> 13:51.189
What's going on?

13:53.232 --> 13:55.985
You really sealed me in ice, huh...

13:56.736 --> 14:00.281
Don't expect something like this
to keep me still for long.

14:00.782 --> 14:03.493
The only ones who can seal me...

14:03.743 --> 14:05.053
...are witches.

14:05.053 --> 14:06.037
This is bad.

14:06.955 --> 14:08.331
What are you doing?! Stop struggling!

14:08.331 --> 14:10.792
Stop... don't touch the demon sword!

14:10.959 --> 14:12.210
Don't look at the demon sword!

14:15.755 --> 14:17.398
What are you doing?!

14:17.632 --> 14:18.883
Let it go! It's mine!

14:18.883 --> 14:20.151
Get away! Stop it!

14:20.151 --> 14:21.260
It doesn't belong to any of you!

14:21.403 --> 14:23.179
It's mine! That thing's mine!

14:23.596 --> 14:24.906
It's started...

14:25.181 --> 14:27.116
You can try to seal away a demon sword,

14:27.350 --> 14:29.769
but people will still get
swayed by its immense power

14:30.103 --> 14:31.646
and their minds get taken over.

14:32.522 --> 14:34.262
Once it's done to one person,
that'll be the end.

14:34.263 --> 14:36.693
The temptation will spread like ripples.

14:37.402 --> 14:39.153
Anyone who desires my power

14:39.570 --> 14:41.406
will lose their minds.

14:42.240 --> 14:45.201
Mere humans will not
be able to go against it.

14:45.994 --> 14:48.705
But that woman poses a problem.

14:49.163 --> 14:50.623
Why is she not shaken up?

14:51.541 --> 14:53.459
What actually is she?

14:54.711 --> 14:55.962
What's this?

14:56.671 --> 14:58.756
What in the world is going on?

14:59.674 --> 15:01.426
What a troubling sight.

15:02.510 --> 15:04.929
Allow me to deal with this.

15:05.638 --> 15:08.474
I told them to not let you
out of the command center!

15:08.891 --> 15:10.393
And you lot!

15:10.768 --> 15:13.229
We have not made any orders
to sortie seekers!

15:15.273 --> 15:17.900
Stop! Have you all also gotten affected?!

15:18.192 --> 15:19.027
Ashgan?!

15:19.527 --> 15:22.596
No. Humans who got swayed by Ashgan

15:22.596 --> 15:25.016
would not be able to make
such controlled movements.

15:25.491 --> 15:26.701
Shoot.

15:30.472 --> 15:32.874
Someone is framing the witch?

15:33.225 --> 15:36.335
Based on my experience,
I have a good idea who it might be.

15:36.669 --> 15:38.796
This is even their usual method.

15:39.106 --> 15:40.381
You wouldn't be able to know.

15:40.882 --> 15:42.800
But you're not uninvolved in this.

15:44.594 --> 15:49.073
Those people target witches regardless
of whether they are good or evil,

15:49.073 --> 15:51.073
and hunt them down, no matter the means.

15:52.101 --> 15:55.813
The shadow of the just
and noble Paladin Corps,

15:56.397 --> 15:58.816
underground witch-hunting specialists.

15:59.609 --> 16:01.152
The Executioners.

16:04.530 --> 16:09.869
I knew that ignorantly accepting
the sword would lead to this.

16:11.454 --> 16:13.456
In other words,
this is all according to plan.

16:13.831 --> 16:16.000
Even amid all this chaos,

16:16.375 --> 16:22.231
I was able to create a faithful army
unaffected by the demon sword.

16:24.008 --> 16:26.677
By using this forbidden instrument.

16:30.223 --> 16:32.600
Now, then. Where is Helga?

16:33.142 --> 16:34.435
I wonder where she is.

16:34.727 --> 16:36.312
Look for her.

16:40.483 --> 16:43.402
The Executioners
set this witch incident up?

16:43.653 --> 16:44.503
Yes.

16:44.503 --> 16:45.822
That doesn't make any sense.

16:46.239 --> 16:48.783
The Executioners are
the symbols of the dark ages.

16:49.200 --> 16:51.744
They are the abominable existence
from a thousand years ago.

16:52.120 --> 16:55.540
There is no way history would
record the existence of a shadow.

16:55.998 --> 16:59.961
Because of my line of work, I know
more about the Holy Church than you.

17:00.920 --> 17:03.172
There is no evidence that
an Executioner is behind all of this.

17:03.631 --> 17:06.134
It's all speculation I made
based on experience.

17:06.759 --> 17:09.262
But doesn't it ring a bell for you?

17:10.930 --> 17:12.723
Isn't there anyone
pretending to be of help

17:13.057 --> 17:16.644
and approached you
with a smile on their face?

17:19.521 --> 17:21.398
You said it was speculation.

17:21.983 --> 17:24.042
Yes, that's all it amounts to.

17:24.359 --> 17:25.528
That's nonsense.

17:25.987 --> 17:27.800
For now, that is...

17:28.071 --> 17:30.491
Yes. Let's leave it as that for now.

17:32.785 --> 17:34.785
Command center, respond.

17:37.248 --> 17:39.292
What's wrong? Respond!

17:39.834 --> 17:42.920
Seems like it's one step away
from nonsense now, isn't it?

17:48.885 --> 17:52.989
I was worried it wouldn't get through
because of your elemental power.

17:53.264 --> 17:54.432
Thank goodness.

17:55.016 --> 17:58.160
You really are weak to heat, Colonel.

17:58.644 --> 18:00.438
Lo... well...

18:04.525 --> 18:08.863
If anyone ever harms you,
the elemental will be enraged, won't it?

18:09.447 --> 18:11.690
You've come to know a little too much,

18:11.691 --> 18:13.910
and it doesn't make you
a good pawn any longer.

18:14.410 --> 18:18.497
Although he has always
intended to dispose of you.

18:23.169 --> 18:25.630
You're an upright and just man.

18:25.838 --> 18:28.716
So it would be hard for
Executioners to use you.

18:29.091 --> 18:31.594
Perfect for fighting witches,

18:32.011 --> 18:35.389
but still not worth a demon sword.

18:35.848 --> 18:37.491
How terrible.

18:38.976 --> 18:41.354
Farewell, Colonel.

18:49.070 --> 18:51.280
I have nowhere else to run...

18:52.406 --> 18:54.200
This is where I'll meet my end.

18:55.159 --> 18:57.261
I got branded as a murderer.

18:57.453 --> 18:59.830
This is how my life ends.

19:00.748 --> 19:03.726
Ah... I wanted a boyfriend...

19:07.129 --> 19:09.298
Hmph. What a skillful girl.

19:10.067 --> 19:12.760
Vice-captain, I'll leave her to you.

19:26.857 --> 19:29.277
I'm curious as to what you are...

19:30.486 --> 19:32.947
Let me know all about it after this.

19:37.451 --> 19:38.828
Stop it!

19:39.412 --> 19:42.915
Oh? So that's where you were, Helga.

19:44.625 --> 19:45.459
Helga.

19:46.335 --> 19:47.712
Unsheathe me.

19:48.754 --> 19:52.341
It's only about time before
my form will be freed.

19:53.009 --> 19:54.885
If it's unavoidable at this point,

19:55.469 --> 19:58.514
then unsheathing me with
your own hands would be the wisest choice.

19:59.348 --> 20:01.267
The only way for you to survive

20:01.809 --> 20:04.270
is to unsheathe me.

20:05.479 --> 20:06.814
That's true.

20:07.648 --> 20:09.233
That man is after the demon sword.

20:09.900 --> 20:11.569
In my current condition,

20:11.902 --> 20:15.698
my lack of resistance will make me end up
telling him how to release the sword.

20:16.907 --> 20:18.743
But I won't let that happen.

20:19.368 --> 20:22.955
What someone other than me needs
in order for unsheathe the sword...

20:23.539 --> 20:26.459
If I die, no one will never
be able to get that.

20:27.418 --> 20:29.111
I just have to die.

20:29.545 --> 20:31.881
That way, they won't be able
to do what they want!

20:33.049 --> 20:34.633
I wanted a boyfriend...

20:35.259 --> 20:36.886
I wanted to be happy.

20:37.762 --> 20:39.347
I didn't want things to end like this,

20:40.222 --> 20:42.725
but I won't just give up my duty now!

20:43.392 --> 20:45.936
I'm going to protect the world
from the demon sword.

20:46.395 --> 20:50.399
That's the reason why I wasn't
able to get anything I want!

20:53.545 --> 20:55.255
Why is she moving on her own will?

20:55.529 --> 20:57.365
Is my control not working?

20:57.740 --> 20:58.991
Is she actually human?!

21:01.369 --> 21:03.537
Hey! Use some spell or something!

21:03.704 --> 21:05.539
All I can do is misfire things!

21:12.046 --> 21:13.481
I can't let that happen.

21:13.631 --> 21:16.008
Both the witch and
the demon sword are valuable.

21:21.097 --> 21:23.140
Hey! What are you doing, bastard?!

21:25.434 --> 21:28.329
Go! Forget me and protect the demon sword!

21:28.604 --> 21:29.663
Like hell I can!

21:29.939 --> 21:33.025
I have to take you with me,
or it's pointless!

21:34.169 --> 21:36.153
Then... save me.

21:37.113 --> 21:39.240
If your duty is to take me with you,

21:39.657 --> 21:40.908
then protect the demon sword!

21:42.594 --> 21:44.762
Come and save me!

21:48.707 --> 21:49.750
Why did I do this...

21:50.167 --> 21:51.168
It's too reckless.

21:52.211 --> 21:53.754
That's correct.

21:54.505 --> 21:57.591
I know everything about you.

21:57.967 --> 22:00.319
Hope doesn't suit you.

22:01.679 --> 22:05.115
This base and the witch are both mine.

22:05.115 --> 22:07.393
And in time, the demon sword, too.

22:08.769 --> 22:10.646
Up to this point, and from now on...

22:10.813 --> 22:12.481
There is no hope for you.

22:13.649 --> 22:15.943
I've always been alone all this time.

22:16.569 --> 22:17.945
No one will save me.

22:18.362 --> 22:19.697
There is no hope for me.

22:20.299 --> 22:22.967
I... know that.

24:00.464 --> 24:03.509
Then, I'll also use...

24:04.051 --> 24:05.177
...my trump card.

24:05.928 --> 24:09.990
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Act III)
Next episode, "The Witch and the Demon Sword - Act III"
